{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05325","headline":"夜游曲 · 郑愔","name":"夜游曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"汉室欢娱盛，魏国文雅遒。\n许史多暮宿，应陈从夜游。\n西园讌公子，北里召王侯。\n讵似将军猎，空嗟亭尉留。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑愔","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05325.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05325","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}